{"format":"mandarin-paket","version":1,"id":"hsk-h2-14","typ":"text","titel":"喝咖啡 · Kaffee trinken","thema":"HSK 2","beschreibung":"Lesetext HSK 2, 11 Sätze.","saetze":[{"nr":1,"w":[["在","Zài"],["中国","Zhōng guó"],["，"],["很","hěn"],["多","duō"],["人","rén"],["喜欢","xǐ huan"],["喝","hē"],["茶","chá"],["。"]],"de":"In China trinken viele Leute gern Tee.","audio":"audio/01.mp3","langsam":"audio/01-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":2,"w":[["但是","Dàn shì"],["现在","xiàn zài"],["，"],["喝","hē"],["咖啡","kā fēi"],["的","de"],["人","rén"],["也","yě"],["很","hěn"],["多","duō"],["。"]],"de":"Aber heute trinken auch viele Kaffee.","audio":"audio/02.mp3","langsam":"audio/02-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":3,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["家","jiā"],["旁边","páng biān"],["有","yǒu"],["一","yí"],["个","ge"],["咖啡","kā fēi"],["店","diàn"],["。"]],"de":"Neben meiner Wohnung gibt es ein Café.","audio":"audio/03.mp3","langsam":"audio/03-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":4,"w":[["每天","Měi tiān"],["早上","zǎo shang"],["，"],["我","wǒ"],["去","qù"],["那儿","nàr"],["买","mǎi"],["一","yì"],["杯","bēi"],["咖啡","kā fēi"],["。"]],"de":"Jeden Morgen kaufe ich dort einen Kaffee.","audio":"audio/04.mp3","langsam":"audio/04-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":5,"w":[["店","Diàn"],["里","lǐ"],["的","de"],["服务员","fú wù yuán"],["已经","yǐ jīng"],["认识","rèn shi"],["我","wǒ"],["了","le"],["。"]],"de":"Die Bedienung kennt mich schon.","audio":"audio/05.mp3","langsam":"audio/05-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":6,"w":[["她","Tā"],["每天","měi tiān"],["笑","xiào"],["着","zhe"],["说","shuō"],["："],["“"],["早上","zǎo shang"],["好","hǎo"],["！"],["一","yì"],["杯","bēi"],["咖啡","kā fēi"],["，"],["对","duì"],["吗","ma"],["？"],["”"]],"de":"Sie sagt jeden Tag lächelnd: «Guten Morgen! Einen Kaffee, richtig?»","audio":"audio/06.mp3","langsam":"audio/06-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":7,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["说","shuō"],["："],["“"],["对","duì"],["，"],["谢谢","xiè xie"],["！"],["”"]],"de":"Ich sage: «Genau, danke!»","audio":"audio/07.mp3","langsam":"audio/07-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":8,"w":[["一","Yì"],["杯","bēi"],["咖啡","kā fēi"],["二十八","èr shí bā"],["块","kuài"],["，"],["比","bǐ"],["茶","chá"],["贵","guì"],["。"]],"de":"Ein Kaffee kostet achtundzwanzig Yuan, teurer als Tee.","audio":"audio/08.mp3","langsam":"audio/08-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":9,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["妻子","qī zi"],["说","shuō"],["咖啡","kā fēi"],["对","duì"],["身体","shēn tǐ"],["不","bù"],["好","hǎo"],["。"]],"de":"Meine Frau sagt, Kaffee sei nicht gut für die Gesundheit.","audio":"audio/09.mp3","langsam":"audio/09-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":10,"w":[["她","Tā"],["希望","xī wàng"],["我","wǒ"],["每天","měi tiān"],["喝","hē"],["茶","chá"],["。"]],"de":"Sie möchte, dass ich jeden Tag Tee trinke.","audio":"audio/10.mp3","langsam":"audio/10-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":11,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["想","xiǎng"],["："],["早上","zǎo shang"],["喝","hē"],["咖啡","kā fēi"],["，"],["晚上","wǎn shang"],["喝","hē"],["茶","chá"],["，"],["可以","kě yǐ"],["吧","ba"],["？"]],"de":"Ich denke: Morgens Kaffee, abends Tee, das geht doch?","audio":"audio/11.mp3","langsam":"audio/11-langsam.mp3"}],"woerter":{"在":{"py":"Zài","art":"V/Präp","de":"sich befinden; in, an; gerade (tun)","herl":"Ortsangabe steht vor dem Verb: 在学校工作. Vor Verben auch «gerade»: 我在看书.","audio":"audio/w/1.mp3"},"中国":{"py":"Zhōng guó","art":"Name","de":"China","herl":"中 Mitte + 国 Land: «Reich der Mitte».","audio":"audio/w/2.mp3"},"很":{"py":"hěn","art":"Adv","de":"sehr","herl":"Vor Adjektiven oft nur Bindeglied: 天气很好 = Das Wetter ist gut.","audio":"audio/w/3.mp3"},"多":{"py":"duō","art":"Adj","de":"viel, viele; mehr","herl":"Zwei 夕 (Abend) übereinander: «viele Abende». 多吃 = mehr essen.","audio":"audio/w/4.mp3"},"人":{"py":"rén","art":"N","de":"Mensch, Person","herl":"Bild eines gehenden Menschen mit zwei Beinen.","audio":"audio/w/5.mp3"},"喜欢":{"py":"xǐ huan","art":"V","de":"mögen, gern haben","herl":"喜 Freude + 欢 fröhlich. 喜欢 + Verb = etwas gern tun.","audio":"audio/w/6.mp3"},"喝":{"py":"hē","art":"V","de":"trinken","herl":"口 Mund + 曷 (Lautteil).","audio":"audio/w/7.mp3"},"茶":{"py":"chá","art":"N","de":"Tee","herl":"艹 Pflanze + 人 Mensch + 木 Baum: die Pflanze zwischen Mensch und Baum.","audio":"audio/w/8.mp3"},"但是":{"py":"Dàn shì","art":"Konj","de":"aber","herl":"但 nur + 是.","audio":"audio/w/9.mp3"},"现在":{"py":"xiàn zài","art":"N","de":"jetzt","herl":"现 erscheinen + 在 sein: «was gerade da ist».","audio":"audio/w/10.mp3"},"咖啡":{"py":"kā fēi","art":"N","de":"Kaffee","herl":"Lautumschrift von «Kaffee», beide mit 口.","audio":"audio/w/11.mp3"},"的":{"py":"de","art":"Part","de":"Besitz- und Attributpartikel («-s», «von»)","herl":"白 weiss + 勺 Löffel; ursprünglich «hell, klar». Heute grammatisch: 我的 = mein, 好吃的菜 = feines Essen.","audio":"audio/w/12.mp3"},"也":{"py":"yě","art":"Adv","de":"auch","herl":"Steht immer vor dem Verb: 我也喜欢.","audio":"audio/w/13.mp3"},"我":{"py":"Wǒ","art":"Pron","de":"ich","herl":"Ursprünglich Bild einer Hellebarde (Waffe 戈 mit gezackter Klinge). Wurde wegen des gleichen Lauts für «ich» entlehnt.","audio":"audio/w/14.mp3"},"家":{"py":"jiā","art":"N","de":"Familie, Zuhause; ZW für Firmen","herl":"宀 Dach + 豕 Schwein: ein Haus mit Vieh galt als Heim. 在家 = zu Hause.","audio":"audio/w/15.mp3"},"旁边":{"py":"páng biān","art":"Ortswort","de":"neben, daneben","herl":"旁 Seite + 边 Rand.","audio":"audio/w/16.mp3"},"有":{"py":"yǒu","art":"V","de":"haben; es gibt","herl":"Hand 𠂇 hält ein Stück Fleisch (月 = 肉): etwas besitzen. Verneint mit 没: 没有.","audio":"audio/w/17.mp3"},"一":{"py":"yí","art":"Zahl","de":"eins, ein","herl":"Ein Strich. Ton wechselt: vor 4. Ton yí (一个), sonst yì (一些), allein yī.","audio":"audio/w/18.mp3"},"个":{"py":"ge","art":"ZW","de":"allgemeines Zählwort","herl":"Steht zwischen Zahl/这/那 und Nomen: 三个人. Wird im Deutschen nicht übersetzt.","audio":"audio/w/19.mp3"},"店":{"py":"diàn","art":"N","de":"Laden, Geschäft","herl":"广 Gebäude + 占 (Lautteil).","audio":"audio/w/20.mp3"},"每天":{"py":"Měi tiān","art":"N","de":"jeden Tag","herl":"每 jeder + 天 Tag.","audio":"audio/w/21.mp3"},"早上":{"py":"zǎo shang","art":"N","de":"Morgen, früh am Morgen","herl":"早 früh + 上. 早上好 = guten Morgen.","audio":"audio/w/22.mp3"},"去":{"py":"qù","art":"V","de":"gehen, hingehen, fahren nach","herl":"Bewegung vom Sprecher weg. Gegenteil: 来 kommen.","audio":"audio/w/23.mp3"},"那儿":{"py":"nàr","art":"Pron","de":"dort","herl":"那 jenes + 儿. Auch 那里.","audio":"audio/w/24.mp3"},"买":{"py":"mǎi","art":"V","de":"kaufen","herl":"3. Ton. Achtung: 卖 mài (4. Ton) heisst verkaufen.","audio":"audio/w/25.mp3"},"杯":{"py":"bēi","art":"ZW","de":"Tasse, Glas (Zählwort)","herl":"一杯茶 = eine Tasse Tee.","audio":"audio/w/26.mp3"},"里":{"py":"lǐ","art":"Ortswort","de":"in, drinnen","herl":"Nach dem Nomen: 商店里 = im Laden.","audio":"audio/w/27.mp3"},"服务员":{"py":"fú wù yuán","art":"N","de":"Kellner, Bedienung","herl":"服务 dienen + 员 Person.","audio":"audio/w/28.mp3"},"已经":{"py":"yǐ jīng","art":"Adv","de":"schon, bereits","herl":"Meist mit 了: 已经走了 = ist schon weg.","audio":"audio/w/29.mp3"},"认识":{"py":"rèn shi","art":"V","de":"kennen, kennenlernen","herl":"认 erkennen + 识 wissen.","audio":"audio/w/30.mp3"},"了":{"py":"le","art":"Part","de":"(abgeschlossene Handlung, Veränderung)","herl":"Nach dem Verb: Handlung ist geschehen (我买了). Am Satzende: neue Lage (下雨了 = jetzt regnet es).","audio":"audio/w/31.mp3"},"她":{"py":"Tā","art":"Pron","de":"sie","herl":"女 Frau + 也 (Lautteil). Gleich ausgesprochen wie 他.","audio":"audio/w/32.mp3"},"笑":{"py":"xiào","art":"V","de":"lachen, lächeln","herl":"竹 Bambus über 夭: Bambus im Wind wie ein lachender Mensch.","audio":"audio/w/33.mp3"},"着":{"py":"zhe","art":"Part","de":"(andauernder Zustand)","herl":"Nach dem Verb: 笑着说 = lachend sagen, 穿着 = trägt gerade.","audio":"audio/w/34.mp3"},"说":{"py":"shuō","art":"V","de":"sagen, sprechen","herl":"讠 Rede + 兑 (Lautteil). 说汉语 = Chinesisch sprechen.","audio":"audio/w/35.mp3"},"好":{"py":"hǎo","art":"Adj","de":"gut; gern, einverstanden","herl":"女 Frau + 子 Kind: Mutter mit Kind steht für «gut». Als Antwort: «Einverstanden!»","audio":"audio/w/36.mp3"},"对":{"py":"duì","art":"Präp/Adj","de":"für, gegenüber; richtig","herl":"对身体好 = gut für die Gesundheit. 对！ = Richtig!","audio":"audio/w/37.mp3"},"吗":{"py":"ma","art":"Part","de":"(Fragepartikel)","herl":"Macht aus einem Satz eine Ja/Nein-Frage: 你好吗？","audio":"audio/w/38.mp3"},"谢谢":{"py":"xiè xie","art":"Ausdruck","de":"danke","herl":"讠 Rede + 射 (Lautteil). Antwort: 不客气.","audio":"audio/w/39.mp3"},"二十八":{"py":"èr shí bā","art":"Zahl","de":"achtundzwanzig","herl":"二十 zwanzig + 八 acht.","audio":"audio/w/40.mp3"},"块":{"py":"kuài","art":"ZW","de":"Yuan (mündlich); Stück","herl":"土 Erde + 夬 (Lautteil): ursprünglich Erdklumpen. 一块手表 = eine Uhr.","audio":"audio/w/41.mp3"},"比":{"py":"bǐ","art":"Präp","de":"als (Vergleich)","herl":"Zwei Menschen nebeneinander: vergleichen. A比B贵 = A ist teurer als B.","audio":"audio/w/42.mp3"},"贵":{"py":"guì","art":"Adj","de":"teuer","herl":"贝 Muschel (Geld) unten.","audio":"audio/w/43.mp3"},"妻子":{"py":"qī zi","art":"N","de":"Ehefrau","herl":"妻 Ehefrau + 子.","audio":"audio/w/44.mp3"},"身体":{"py":"shēn tǐ","art":"N","de":"Körper; Gesundheit","herl":"身 Körper + 体 Leib. 身体好 = gesund.","audio":"audio/w/45.mp3"},"不":{"py":"bù","art":"Adv","de":"nicht","herl":"Ton wechselt: vor 4. Ton bú (不去), sonst bù.","audio":"audio/w/46.mp3"},"希望":{"py":"xī wàng","art":"V","de":"hoffen","herl":"希 hoffen + 望 hinausschauen.","audio":"audio/w/47.mp3"},"想":{"py":"xiǎng","art":"V/Hilfsverb","de":"möchten; denken; vermissen","herl":"相 (Lautteil) + 心 Herz. 我想你 = Ich vermisse dich.","audio":"audio/w/48.mp3"},"晚上":{"py":"wǎn shang","art":"N","de":"Abend","herl":"晚 spät + 上.","audio":"audio/w/49.mp3"},"可以":{"py":"kě yǐ","art":"Hilfsverb","de":"können, dürfen","herl":"可 können + 以. 可以吗？ = Geht das?","audio":"audio/w/50.mp3"},"吧":{"py":"ba","art":"Part","de":"(Vorschlag, Vermutung)","herl":"我们走吧 = gehen wir! 你是学生吧？ = du bist Student, oder?","audio":"audio/w/51.mp3"}},"zeichen":{"中":{"de":"Mitte","herl":"Ein Pfeil durch die Mitte einer Zielscheibe."},"国":{"de":"Land, Staat","herl":"囗 Grenze + 玉 Jade: Kostbares innerhalb der Grenzen."},"喜":{"de":"Freude","herl":"Trommel über 口 Mund: festliche Freude."},"欢":{"de":"fröhlich","herl":"又 + 欠 offener Mund."},"但":{"de":"aber, nur","herl":"亻 Mensch + 旦 (Lautteil)."},"是":{"de":"sein","herl":"日 Sonne über 正 richtig: ursprünglich «so ist es». Verbindet Nomen: 我是学生. Vor Adjektiven steht 很, nicht 是."},"现":{"de":"erscheinen; jetzt","herl":"王 Jade + 见 sehen: Jade glänzt sichtbar."},"在":{"de":"sich befinden; in, an; gerade (tun)","herl":"Ortsangabe steht vor dem Verb: 在学校工作. Vor Verben auch «gerade»: 我在看书."},"咖":{"de":"(in 咖啡)","herl":"口 + 加 (Lautteil)."},"啡":{"de":"(in 咖啡)","herl":"口 + 非 (Lautteil)."},"旁":{"de":"Seite","herl":"Ursprünglich «weit, umfassend»."},"边":{"de":"Seite, Rand","herl":"辶 gehen + 力."},"每":{"de":"jeder","herl":"每个星期 = jede Woche."},"天":{"de":"Tag; Himmel","herl":"Mensch 大 mit Strich darüber: der Himmel über dem Kopf."},"早":{"de":"früh","herl":"日 Sonne über 十: die Sonne steigt."},"上":{"de":"auf, oben; vorig; hinaufgehen","herl":"Strich über der Grundlinie. 桌子上 = auf dem Tisch, 上个月 = letzten Monat."},"那":{"de":"jenes, das; dann","herl":"那是… = das ist…"},"服":{"de":"Kleidung; dienen","herl":"月 + 𠬝 Hand."},"务":{"de":"Aufgabe","herl":"夂 + 力 Kraft."},"员":{"de":"Person, Mitglied","herl":"口 + 贝."},"已":{"de":"bereits","herl":"Bild einer Schlange; als Laut entlehnt."},"经":{"de":"durchgehen; regelmässig","herl":"纟 Faden + 圣: Kettfaden am Webstuhl."},"认":{"de":"erkennen","herl":"讠 Rede + 人 Mensch."},"识":{"de":"wissen, kennen","herl":"讠 Rede + 只 (Lautteil)."},"谢":{"de":"danken","herl":"讠 Rede + 射 (Lautteil)."},"二":{"de":"zwei","herl":"Zwei Striche."},"十":{"de":"zehn","herl":"Ein Kreuz: alle vier Richtungen, «vollständig»."},"八":{"de":"acht","herl":"Zwei Striche, die sich trennen."},"妻":{"de":"Ehefrau","herl":"Hand über einer Frau."},"子":{"de":"Kind; Nomensuffix","herl":"Bild eines Kindes mit ausgestreckten Armen."},"身":{"de":"Körper","herl":"Bild eines Menschen mit betontem Bauch."},"体":{"de":"Körper","herl":"亻 Mensch + 本 Wurzel."},"希":{"de":"hoffen","herl":"Gewebe, selten; daraus «wünschen»."},"望":{"de":"schauen; hoffen","herl":"Mensch schaut zum Mond 月."},"晚":{"de":"spät","herl":"日 Sonne + 免 (Lautteil)."},"可":{"de":"können","herl":"口 Mund + 丁: zustimmen."},"以":{"de":"mit, um zu","herl":"Bild eines Pfluges."}},"hsk":2}